  "description": "*\"Get down on all fours like a dog. I'm gonna fuck you good.\"*\n\nWeb novels were her life and her truth. And among them, love was the most corrupting. It was only natural that Maeng Hae-Eun was bewitched by Nam Ju-Kang, who bore an uncanny resemblance to the male lead in her novel. A gangster organization disguised as a corporation. Tall, broad shoulders, thick muscles. A cold tone and charisma to boot. To capture the ideal man she'd longed for in her dreams, Hae-Eun decides to become the female lead in a tragic romance.\n\n(Source: Ridibooks, translated)",
